# Keep secrets and private machine material out of Cursor's code context.
# This is defense in depth, not protection from terminal or MCP tools.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.template
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/.ssh/**
**/.aws/**
**/.gcp/**
**/.azure/**
**/private/**
**/*secret*
